{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-dijiayureqiandao",
  "id": "source-29003",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29003001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "看主人这副胸有成竹的样子，应该是已经有了答案？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然！全TV中被迪迦断过角的怪物一共7个！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "bingo！主人又对了，正确的答案就是7个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "顺便一提，虽然TV中被迪迦断角的怪物只有7个，但迪迦人间体还弄断过建筑物的角，此外还有只怪物在海底被弄断过脚……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不可思议，主人竟然还掌握了比标准答案还要更加标准的答案吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "连迪迦都对主人表示了认可呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这不算什么，整个TV剧集我都研究了个遍，优纪还有什么问题都尽管问吧，不可能再有问题可以难倒我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么，请主人听好了——最后的问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "迪迦从剧集开始到现在，一共说了多少次“恰”？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "？？？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29003012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
